{"withCaptures":[{"kind":"text","rect":{"x":1720,"y":92,"w":100,"h":22},"runs":[{"text":"05 / 12","color":"999999","bold":true,"size":16}],"align":"right","valign":"middle","letterSpacing":2,"lineHeightPx":null,"singleLine":true,"vertical":false,"fontFace":"Microsoft YaHei","z":0},{"kind":"text","rect":{"x":100,"y":120,"w":1720,"h":144},"runs":[{"text":" 企业知识管理的瓶颈不在工具,","color":"1A1A1A","bold":true,"size":60,"breakLine":true},{"text":"在知识的\"失效速度\" ","color":"1A1A1A","bold":true,"size":60}],"align":"left","valign":"top","letterSpacing":0,"lineHeightPx":72,"singleLine":false,"vertical":false,"fontFace":"Microsoft YaHei","z":1},{"kind":"text","rect":{"x":100,"y":340,"w":820,"h":203.984375},"runs":[{"text":" ","color":"1F1F1F","bold":false,"size":24},{"text":"知识在贬值,而不是在积累。","color":"1A1A1A","bold":true,"size":24},{"text":"调研的 200 家企业里,文档平均\"半衰期\"只有 11 个月——一年前的流程文档,今天还能直接用的不到四成。 ","color":"1F1F1F","bold":false,"size":24,"breakLine":true},{"text":" 问题不在存储。每家企业的文档量都在增长,真正掉队的,是让文档保持新鲜的能力。 ","color":"1F1F1F","bold":false,"size":24}],"align":"left","valign":"top","letterSpacing":0,"lineHeightPx":40.8,"singleLine":false,"vertical":false,"fontFace":"Microsoft YaHei","z":2},{"kind":"text","rect":{"x":1000,"y":340,"w":820,"h":203.984375},"runs":[{"text":" ","color":"1F1F1F","bold":false,"size":24},{"text":"失效发生在三个环节。","color":"1A1A1A","bold":true,"size":24},{"text":"写入时缺语境、流转时缺owner、检索时缺时效标注。三个环节叠加,知识库就变成\"档案馆\":什么都有,什么都不敢信。 ","color":"1F1F1F","bold":false,"size":24,"breakLine":true},{"text":" 解方因此不是换一个更好的工具,而是给知识加上\"保质期管理\"——这是下一页的主题。 ","color":"1F1F1F","bold":false,"size":24}],"align":"left","valign":"top","letterSpacing":0,"lineHeightPx":40.8,"singleLine":false,"vertical":false,"fontFace":"Microsoft YaHei","z":3}],"notes":"【核心逻辑】先建立\"知识失效\"这个反直觉判断,为后面的方案页铺路。\n【串场】不用念数据,问一句\"你们去年的文档今天还敢直接用吗\"即可。","canvasBg":"F5F7FA"}